      "questionImage": "",
      "answer": "<span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><b>▶ [เกณฑ์การให้คะแนน </b></span><span style=\"color:#7c3aed\"><b>Candida</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><b> Score]:</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><br>   ↳ 1. </span><span style=\"color:#dc2626\"><b>Severe Sepsis</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#d97706\"><b>2 คะแนน</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> (ข้อเดียวที่ได้ 2 แต้ม!)<br>   ↳ 2. Total Parenteral Nutrition (TPN) = </span><span style=\"color:#d97706\"><b>1 คะแนน</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><br>   ↳ 3. Initial Surgery (ผ่าตัดเมื่อแรกรับ) = </span><span style=\"color:#d97706\"><b>1 คะแนน</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><br>   ↳ 4. Multifocal </span><span style=\"color:#7c3aed\"><b>Candida</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> Colonization (พบเชื้อ &gt;= 2 ตำแหน่ง) = </span><span style=\"color:#d97706\"><b>1 คะแนน</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#d97706\"><b>💡 [จุดเน้นข้อสอบ]:</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> </span><span style=\"color:#dc2626\"><b>Severe Sepsis</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> ได้ 2 แต้ม ส่วน TPN, Surgery, Multifocal ได้ข้อละ 1 แต้ม</span>",
      "answerImage": "",
      "note": "Invasive Fungal Infections (IFI)"
