      "question": "<span style=\"color:#1e2321\"><b>▶ [โจทย์]:</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> A 55-year-old female presents with her first episode of non-severe Clostridioides difficile infection. Which of the following is the recommended first-line treatment?<br>ก. Oral Metronidazole 500 mg TID x 10-14 days<br>ข. IV </span><span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Vancomycin</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> 125 mg QID x 10 days<br>ค. Oral </span><span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Vancomycin</b></span><span style=\"color:#1e2321\"> 125 mg QID x 10 days<br>ง. IV Metronidazole 500 mg q8h<br>จ. Oral Rifaximin 400 mg TID x 14 days</span>",
